rungsprozess auf die strukturelle Übersetzung konzentriert, wirst du oft entwicklerfreundliche Funktionen wie benutzerdefinierte Namenskonventionen, zusätzliche Typinformationen oder spezialisierte Client-Methoden hinzufügen wollen. Codamas Visitor-System macht diese Erweiterungen unkompliziert und leistungsstark.","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":967},"end":{"line":23,"column":337,"offset":1303}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1,"offset":967},"end":{"line":23,"column":337,"offset":1303}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mehr darüber, wie du deine konvertierte IDL mit Visitors anpassen und erweitern kannst, erfährst du in der Lektion ","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":1307},"end":{"line":25,"column":116,"offset":1422}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"/de/courses/create-your-sdk-with-codama/updating-codama-idl","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Aktualisierung der Codama IDL","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":117,"offset":1423},"end":{"line":25,"column":146,"offset":1452}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":116,"offset":1422},"end":{"line":25,"column":208,"offset":1514}}},{"type":"text","value":".","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":208,"offset":1514},"end":{"line":25,"column":209,"offset":1515}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":1307},"end":{"line":25,"column":209,"offset":1515}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":25,"column":209,"offset":1515}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Erstelle deine Codama IDL aus Anchor IDL\r\n\r\nDie Erstellung einer Codama IDL aus Anchor ist äußerst unkompliziert. Nachdem du deine Anchor IDL mit anchor build generiert hast, müssen wir das Paket '@codama/nodes-from-anchor' installieren:\r\n\r\n```\r\npnpm install codama @codama/nodes-from-anchor\r\n```\r\n\r\nUnd dann die Anchor IDL direkt mit der `rootNodeFromAnchor ` Funktion konvertieren:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nimport { createFromRoot } from 'codama';\r\nimport { rootNodeFromAnchor } from '@codama/nodes-from-anchor';\r\nimport anchorIdl from 'anchor-idl.json';\r\n\r\nconst codama = createFromRoot(rootNodeFromAnchor(anchorIdl));\r\n```\r\n\r\nDies gibt dir eine voll funktionsfähige Codama IDL, die bereit für die Client-Generierung ist. Die wahre Stärke von Codama liegt jedoch in der Fähigkeit, deine IDL über das hinaus zu erweitern und anzupassen, was mit reinen Anchor-Definitionen möglich ist.\r\n\r\nDa sich der Konvertierungsprozess auf die strukturelle Übersetzung konzentriert, wirst du oft entwicklerfreundliche Funktionen wie benutzerdefinierte Namenskonventionen, zusätzliche Typinformationen oder spezialisierte Client-Methoden hinzufügen wollen. Codamas Visitor-System macht diese Erweiterungen unkompliziert und leistungsstark.\r\n\r\nMehr darüber, wie du deine konvertierte IDL mit Visitors anpassen und erweitern kannst, erfährst du in der Lektion [Aktualisierung der Codama IDL](/de/courses/create-your-sdk-with-codama/updating-codama-idl).","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"text","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"pnpm install codama @codama/nodes-from-anchor"}]}]}]}]}]}},"code-1":{"lang":"ts","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"import"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" { createFromRoot } "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"from"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" '"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#E7EE98"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"codama"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"'"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":";"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"import"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" { rootNodeFromAnchor } "}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"from"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" '"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#E7EE98"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"@codama/nodes-from-anchor"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"'"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":";"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"import"}]}